      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/0QwQ0/dsh-discord-richpresence/zipball/v0.2.0",
      "body": "Add a rich mode toggle in Settings -> General.\n\n- Default OFF: vague, user-configurable status lines only (unchanged)\n- Switch ON in Settings -> General -> Rich presence detail: the plugin pushes smarter, data-driven status lines — thinking turn/step (大肥鱼正在思考 6/195), total input tokens (大肥鱼正在记笔记 38.7M), elapsed LLM thinking time (大肥鱼已经思考了 30m46s), and typing hints (正在指导大肥鱼) — picked intelligently and randomly, each staying on screen for at least 8 seconds\n- The toggle is persisted at runtime in the discord-richpresence settings namespace\n- Privacy preserved: rich templates carry scalar facts only, never workspace content\n- New browser half (lib/client.js) registers the settings row; host half registers the settings namespace and the rich push loop"
    },
