      "body": "dsh-plugin: push vague, user-configurable DSH interaction states to the local Discord client as Rich Presence.\n\n- Dependency-free Discord RPC client (local IPC: named pipe / TCP fallback, handshake, SET_ACTIVITY, ping/pong, auto-reconnect)\n- Coarse content-free event mapping: userInput / agentWorking / tools / forking / idle status groups, each a user-editable list\n- No tray icon, no UI: host-side bundle injected into the harness startup flow at install time\n- Privacy: only configured status strings ever reach Discord"
